        "comments": "The assembly drTriBocc1.hap1.1 is based on 36x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Order and Orientation of scaffolds on Chromosome 2 between\n59.70-60.67Mb and Chromosome 3 between\n48.37-58.90Mb is unsure.",
